OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks could cost utilities
OL,4,Amore by next spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sussex council says it is looking to
OL,7,Fcharge utility companies to carry out
OL,8,Froadworks during peak hours, in a bid
OL,9,Fto reduce disruption.
OL,11,FBrighton & Hove City Council wants to
OL,12,Fjoin neighbouring local authorities by
OL,13,Fimplementing a lane rental scheme which
OL,14,Fwould enable companies undertaking
OL,15,Froadworks to be charged up to #2,500 a
OL,16,Fday.
OL,18,FAccording to the council, roadworks in
OL,19,FBrighton and Hove currently take about
OL,20,F20 days to complete, compared to two to
OL,21,Ffive days in areas with lane rental
OL,22,Fschemes.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
