OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks could cost utilities
OL,4,Amore by next spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrevor Muten, cabinet member for
OL,7,Ftransport and city infrastructure, told
OL,8,Fthe council's cabinet on Thursday that
OL,9,F"a start as early as spring 2027" was
OL,10,Fsubject to secretary of state approval.
